flowchart TB
    browser[浏览器]
    subgraph app[DrRainAI / DrRainAI]
        web[Web 界面\nReact + TypeScript]
        gateway[Go 网关\nGo]
        core[C++ 业务核心\nC++]
        agent[Python Agent 运行时\nPython，单 Agent]
